</div></section>

<section class="jp-section" style="background:var(--jp-white)"><div class="jp-wrap jp-principles">
 <div class="jp-reveal"><div class="jp-kicker">06 / Visual principles</div><h2 style="margin:0;color:var(--jp-forest);font:500 clamp(39px,5vw,62px)/1.06 var(--jp-serif);letter-spacing:-.045em">Nature gives the palette.<br /><em style="color:var(--jp-leaf)">Clarity gives the structure.</em></h2><p class="jp-intro" style="margin-top:20px">The visual system aims to feel grounded in the material without making the interface feel old-fashioned. Earthy colour is balanced with clean layouts and a strong typographic hierarchy.</p>
 <div class="jp-palette" aria-label="Conceptual Jute Portal colour palette">
  <div class="jp-swatch"><div class="jp-swatch-color" style="background:#142c22"></div><small><b>Forest</b>#142C22</small></div>
