  <div class="jp-swatch"><div class="jp-swatch-color" style="background:#f5f2e9"></div><small><b>Natural paper</b>#F5F2E9</small></div>
 </div></div>
 <div class="jp-principle-list jp-reveal jp-delay-1">
  <article class="jp-principle"><span>01</span><div><h3>Grounded, not dated</h3><p>Natural tones connect to the material, while modern type and spacing keep the experience contemporary.</p></div></article>
  <article class="jp-principle"><span>02</span><div><h3>Content before decoration</h3><p>Clear sections and concise descriptions help visitors understand what each part of the portal offers.</p></div></article>
  <article class="jp-principle"><span>03</span><div><h3>Designed for different screens</h3><p>Flexible grids and responsive type preserve readability from desktop displays to mobile devices.</p></div></article>
  <article class="jp-principle"><span>04</span><div><h3>Trust through consistency</h3><p>Repeated visual patterns create a more coherent experience across product, editorial and directory content.</p></div></article>
 </div>
